# src/

Core gRPC server implementation for Udex, comprising service handlers, middleware, configuration management, and initialization logic. Exports the primary `start()` and `serve()` entry points, along with `EntryService`, `IndexService`, and `HealthzService` implementations.

## Files

- `lib.rs` -- Library root; exports services, public error type, and HealthCheck trait
- `server.rs` -- Server startup and wiring; initializes datastore, services, TLS, and authz interceptor
- `authz.rs` -- JWT validation interceptor; supports static keys and JWKS discovery with algorithm inference
- `config.rs` -- Configuration structures for server, TLS, and authz with validation
- `logging.rs` -- Tracing initialization for JSON (production) and human-readable (test) output
- `entry.rs` -- Entry service implementation; handles CRUD and bulk entry operations with context hashing
- `index.rs` -- Index service implementation; manages index lifecycle and initialization
- `healthz.rs` -- Health check service; aggregates health status from entry and index services
